# 026 = upstream PR #100746: provider-overflow recovery stays armed across
#   the post-compaction rebuild (agent/conversation_loop.py). A compaction that
#   drops rows but grows the actual prompt was sent straight back while
#   awaiting_real_usage_after_compression was still true; now recovery stays
#   armed until the rebuilt request is below threshold, and fails closed
#   (persist + context_compression_exhausted) instead of letting llama.cpp
#   silently truncate. Companion to 019 (FIFO side). ADAPTED to v2026.8.31:
#   the init-site hunk is re-anchored (the #98722 host-timeout comment it
#   follows upstream is absent in this tag); all other hunks verbatim.
#   Upstream tests/website hunks excluded.
#   Drop when HERMES_AGENT_VERSION moves past the tag that includes #100746.
